{"4456470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KRAI LESA: Edge of the Forest", "steam_appid": 4456470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/6d604bd06e840677b96729e1467c86dc.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KRAI LESA </strong>is an eldritch survival-adventure game where you investigate a rotting Siberian landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“SIBERIA, 1991 — <i>Strange warbling is said to beckon from the tundral north, where landscapes stretch mycelian and the earth has a pulse. Brave the wilderness, interrogate your family folklore, and submit yourself to a higher power.</i>”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SURVIVE THE BIOMES OF SIBERIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/8f1f8619d23c86af4127673cf3116d0e.poster.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/8f1f8619d23c86af4127673cf3116d0e.webm?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/8f1f8619d23c86af4127673cf3116d0e.mp4?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandon your family and venture into a randomised open world, with <i>5 distinct Siberian biomes</i> and <i>100+ unique set pieces</i>. All feature special vegetation, creatures, events, and atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">DISCOVER FORGOTTEN STRUCTURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3ce08580dc09344ecf574391dd95fd16.poster.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3ce08580dc09344ecf574391dd95fd16.webm?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3ce08580dc09344ecf574391dd95fd16.mp4?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <i>abandoned sites</i> and learn the stories of fanatics and opportunists past. Investigate what happened to them, <i>solve their puzzles</i>, and avoid the same fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EAT FUNGAL — EAT FERMENTED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/0673d05b9ab048df848298bffc8feef6.poster.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/0673d05b9ab048df848298bffc8feef6.webm?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/0673d05b9ab048df848298bffc8feef6.mp4?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hospitable climate? No problem! This cooking system features <i>creative and elaborate recipes</i> — some from regional cuisines, some from the beyond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SURRENDER YOUR SANITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3bc6da5b52c98cf8bd60a8cc981311a9.poster.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3bc6da5b52c98cf8bd60a8cc981311a9.webm?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/3bc6da5b52c98cf8bd60a8cc981311a9.mp4?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just another health bar! Your sanity reacts to the environment and to your playstyle. Keep it low to <i>mutate the world</i>, unlock <i>new recipes</i>, and gain the courage to perform <i>wicked deeds</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FIND THE HOLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/f7cf403e43ac90bdf29d9ba6038218af.poster.avif?t=1787314431\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/f7cf403e43ac90bdf29d9ba6038218af.webm?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456470/extras/f7cf403e43ac90bdf29d9ba6038218af.mp4?t=1787314431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The earth still sings its siren song, and foreign memories surface at night. Navigate these <i>strange dreams</i> and piece together what happened to your grandma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival-crafting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eastern European-inspired cosmic horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im